	(descr "TI INA186A3IDCKR SC70-6 (DCK). Land per TI INA186 data sheet SBOS761 (www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/ina186.pdf, p23/merge/od/dl/ti/ina186.pdf) p42-44 DCK0006A (4214835/D): body 2.0 x 1.25 (D 1.85-2.15, E1 1.1-1.4), lead span E 1.8-2.4; land example 6X (0.9) x 6X (0.4), 4X (0.65) pitch, (2.2) row centres, (R0.05); pin 1 top-left. The bundled ${OPENDRONE_LIB}/datasheet/INA186A3IDCKR.pdf (2022) omits the DCK drawing. TI land with the toe trimmed (heel edge 0.65 kept). DENSE: budget envelope SC70_6 2.4 (lead direction) vs TI example 3.1: outer edge 1.55 -> 1.20 (0.15 past the 1.05 nominal lead tip, IPC-7351B least toe), pads 0.55 x 0.40 at +-0.925; heel edge 0.65 covers the 0.26-0.46 lead foot. Corrected copy of OpenDrone:SOT-363_SC-70-6 (same frame), F.Fab body, no component silk; spec hardware/tools/land_specs/SOT-363_SC-70-6_Dense.json")
